  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I don't know what the rest of the community will say about this but can you change your schedule of releasing client and server updates from weekend to week, today is once again the situation that you have released some flawed update and it doesn't go to enjoy the weekend, I understand that you are trying to make us have an up-to-date platform but isn't it better to do updates when less people are sitting during the week? Instead of doing it on the weekend where there's the most traffic, if something sits out then suddenly people who work or only have time on the weekend get stressed? I don't want to be mean here, it's just that sometimes people wait all week to meet with their virtual friends, and one update can completely ruin everything literally in seconds. We have also had similar situations before, where after an update everything suddenly blew up, and that too was always on weekends.\n\nIf you did updates during the week, it would work out well for everyone, because you would have a very long time until the weekend to fix bugs, and people wouldn't lose the weekend we really want to play in sometimes.\n\nGreetings",
